  "stageId": "main_05-06",
  "title": "疑兵之计",
  "storyCode": "5-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ab13ed9fe04f372a00eea690ad5597d6d1adf7e1c7dc3f965f7ff4683e239b1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "比我想象的轻松。我越来越好奇当时切尔诺伯格城里究竟发生了什么了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "也许是和这里一模一样的事情，只是根扎得更深，燃烧的势头更猛。不要大意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你知道我连睡觉都很少合眼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎，我已经尽量速战速决了，还是对这些店铺造成了不小的损害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "到时候怕是又要让魏先生签账单，他本来就不那么喜欢“小姐”她们家的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "咦，舒尔洛夫斯基的水晶，老陈，你是不是挺喜欢这个牌子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "还行，他们的吊坠不错，耳环就没那么好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "B1小队，这里是陈，彻底封锁西面入口，降下所有防盗门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我很少看你戴耳环。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "毕竟一般都穿制服返工，留下几个衣柜的衣服放在家里等蛀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "星熊长官！这里是整合运动改造过后的大古广场东L3平面图，请查阅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "辛苦，继续考察吧，有效利用起地形。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "之后我们要找到从这里出发的最佳路线，穿过整合运动的封锁区，不能没有你们的信息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "衣服啊......没想到老陈你竟然会在这上面开销。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你不是一样花大笔钱买了多少辆电单车？衣服这东西，偶尔穿给自己看也没什么不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "工作占用了我很多时间，但它毕竟不是我生活的全部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "如果你不是每天像钟表一样走进办公室，还有加班加得其他人吓到半死，你说的这些话我就都信了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "只能说我们这些当差的，生活还算是过得去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是我有时候会想，阿米娅那样的感染者，还有机会逛街吗？在这里买点自己喜欢的饰品，吃点自己喜欢的东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "也许有。但不是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "C3，这里是陈，清查一楼，缓速推进，安全优先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "是吧。这片大地确实不公平。阿发死了，我却活了下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他们都死了，只有我活了下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈。那条情报是不是真的有价值？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "一定有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "text": "（可，可恨......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "text": "（至少要把你们在这里一起埋了......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "陈Sir！快走！！我们在三楼发现了大量的爆炸物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "就在你脚下的位置！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "text": "近卫局，现在就把你们炸上天！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈！过来！站在盾后面！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "脚底？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
